<title>USA: Omaha cattle up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said in brisk trading slaughter steers and heifers were $0.50 higher.</p>
<p>Steers - select to choice 2-4 1100-1350 lbs 67.00-68.50. Select 65.00-67.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select to mostly choice 2-4 975-1250 lbs 67.00- 68.50, 47 head reputation fed 1133 lbs 69.00. Select 64.50-67.00.</p>
</text>
